<!--
  Spanish (es) translation of TimingText.resx (#117). The English file's comments are the brief for each key.
  One neutral Spanish for Spain and Latin America. Informal address ("tú"), as Windows 11 writes Spanish. Windows'
  Spanish terms (archivo, carpeta, Configuración, equipo). "video" without the accent: the one es file also serves
  Mexico, the US and Latin America, and the RAE accepts "video" in Spain too; Store names keep their exact spelling
  ("Extensión de vídeo AV1"). UI labels named inside a sentence stand in quotation marks (“…”). An exact million takes
  "de" ("1.000.000 de fotos", RAE DPD "cardinales"), so a counted sentence that changes has a _many form; a family
  without one falls back to _other.
-->
